Revealing hidden dynamics from time-series data by ODENet
Pipi Hu a,b,1, Wuyue Yang a,1, Yi Zhu a,b, Liu Hong c,∗
a Yau Mathematical Sciences Center, Tsinghua University, Beijing, 100084, China b Yanqi Lake Beijing Institute of Mathematical Sciences and Applications, Beijing 101408, China c School of Mathematics, Sun Yat-Sen University, Guangzhou, 510275, China
