3. Numerical experiments
In this section, we are going to apply the ODENet to the study of Lotka-Volterra equations in diverse parameter regimes and Lorenz equations in chaotic regimes. Through these examples, the power and advantage of ODENet could be demonstrated.
3.1. Lotka-Volterra equations with and without large noise
